# Core (29006), a level 1 grand boss, sees a level 10 character, more than 8 levels above it,
# cast Ultimate Debuff (4694) on a monster beside it: it wants skill 4215 on the character at
# 1000000 (its fixture template lists the skill, so the NPC can cast). The character's combat
# draws are pinned so the debuff lands.
character Hunter 10
skill 4694 1
roll player 0
random always 0
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.boss.core.Core
npc core 29006 GrandBoss 250 0 0 skill DEBUFF 4215 1
npc wolf 20120 Monster 150 0 0

cast wolf 4694
  S MagicSkillUse caster=player target=wolf skill=4694-1 hit=0 reuse=0 success=0
  S SystemMessage id=46 4:4694,1
  desires core cast(player,4215,move)=1000000
